sequenceDiagram
  autonumber
  participant R as 评审子进程 claude -p
  participant B as Bridge
  participant D as 切号守护 quota-monitor
  participant A as Anthropic API
  participant S as 账号池 claude-accounts.json
  participant C as 在跑的 Claude 体
  R-->>B: 退出码≠0, failure_raw 含 403 disabled
  B->>B: 分类 account_switch, review job 停靠
  B->>D: 写见证文件 + SIGUSR1 叫醒
  D->>A: GET /api/oauth/usage(只读)
  A-->>D: 403 permission_error
  D->>A: GET /api/oauth/profile(只读)
  A-->>D: subscription_status=canceled
  D->>S: 标记 unavailable + 切到下一号(generation+1, lastSwitch)
  D-->>B: Discord 告警 account_dead:personal1 → #flywheel-engineer
  B->>S: 每 60s 读 generation, 发现前进
  B->>B: 停靠的 review job 同 request-id 重入队
  B->>C: mailbox 指令「凭据已切, 重跑上一轮」
  C->>A: 下一 turn 用新钥匙成功
